<title>FRANCE: Alcatel boosted by JP Morgan list.</title>
<headline>Alcatel boosted by JP Morgan list.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom, up 1.47 percent at 689 francs at 1437 GMT, was boosted because investment house J.P. Morgan added the stock to a list of European recovery stocks, dealers said.</p>
<p>An analyst at J.P. Morgan in London confirmed the action. &quot;We included Alcatel today on a list of best European restructuring plays because we believe it has a lot of scope to benefit from its restructuring,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
